// Sunder Ring (BRL-5ss9): six-fighter solo Last Stand. The six spawns sit on a 13-cell ring around
// the centre the boundary closes on, and every other placement is mirrored across both axes, so
// no spawn starts closer to the final convergence. A broken wall ring and destructible cover make
// the centre plaza; six treasure chests sit between the spawns and the plaza, and four corner
// grass beds plus two edge beds give early hiding spots that the closing boundary pushes fighters out of.
(
    recipe_id: MapRecipeId(16),
    revision: 1,
    recipe_version: 5,
    mode_definition_id: ModeDefinitionId(7),
